# This repository is markdown and one PowerShell script. Nothing is built, nothing is
# installed, and there are no secrets. The list below is OS and editor cruft only.
#
# graph/ IS committed on purpose. It is generated by scripts/build-graph.ps1 and can
# always be rebuilt, but an agent that clones this repository should be able to answer
# a structural question without running anything first. Regenerate it after any
# structural change and commit the result alongside the change that caused it.

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor
.vscode/*
!.vscode/mcp.json
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Source material held locally for reading. NEVER committed.
# This repository's rule is that a copyrighted source is represented by an
# original synthesis and its citation details, never by the source text — see
# the copyright handling section of research/99-source-register/source-register.md.
raw/

# Correspondence. NEVER committed. This repository is public.
# Incoming mail carries third-party email addresses, message IDs, tenant IDs and
# — in at least one case already — a OneDrive sharing URL with a live access
# token in the query string. None of that is ours to publish, and a .eml is not
# obviously dangerous when you are looking at a file listing.
#
# It was untracked but not ignored until 2026-08-01, which is the state that
# loses: `git add -A` would have swept it in silently, and the leak guard in
# scripts/verify.ps1 only covers directories named here.
inquiries/

# Transient
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log

# Local Python virtualenvs. Also excluded from the markdown scan in
# scripts/build-graph.ps1 and scripts/verify.ps1 — a venv's vendored LICENSE.md
# files were otherwise scanned in as graph nodes.
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/

# Agent memory. Repo-scoped memory currently lives in VS Code workspaceStorage,
# outside this tree, so it is excluded by construction. These entries are
# defensive: if a future memory backend writes in-tree, it must not be committed.
.memories/
memories/
**/memory-tool/

# MCP server build output and deps
mcp/**/node_modules/
mcp/**/dist/
